---
import { CONFIG } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="sec bg-paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow rv">The math</div>
    <h2 class="h2 rv">A real CMO costs more than <em>your whole runway</em> can take.</h2>
    <p class="sub rv">Early-stage founders end up doing marketing at midnight, or paying someone a retainer to learn their product. There's a third option now.</p>
    <div class="cost-grid">
      <div class="cost rv">
        <small>Full-time CMO</small>
        <div class="amt">$250k<span>/yr</span></div>
        <ul><li>Plus equity and a 3-month search</li><li>One person, one specialty</li><li>Needs a team under them anyway</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="cost rv">
        <small>Agency retainer</small>
        <div class="amt">$5k+<span>/mo</span></div>
        <ul><li>Weeks of onboarding calls</li><li>Junior staff on your account</li><li>Monthly reports, slow changes</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="cost win rv">
        <small>CMOkit</small>
        <div class="amt">{CONFIG.price}<span> once</span></div>
        <ul><li>{CONFIG.counts.agents} specialists across every channel</li><li>Works the moment you prompt it</li><li>Lives in your repo, yours forever</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="foot-note rv">Salary and retainer figures are typical US market ranges, shown for comparison.</p>
  </div>
</section>
